    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Articrafty&quot; is a game about creating artifacts. What will you create? Combine realism and fantasy. Combine characteristics with abilities. Create unique items. Achieve &quot;Legendary&quot; mastery.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create unique things.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with ordinary items at hand. End with a great master who has created &quot;Legendary&quot; artifacts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of magic, breathe life into your artifacts. They will be faithful assistants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your artifacts on enemies. Enemies can improve themselves with items, raising their level. Turn into bosses.</p></li></ul>",
